# Cursor vs Manus roles

**Cursor (this agent):** implement and verify code / content changes in GitHub.  
**Manus:** merge to `main` and publish the target surface. Do **not** ask Derek to manually paste Code Blocks or notify Manus.

## Surfaces

| Surface | After Cursor lands the change |
|---|---|
| `jdsys.biz` (JD SYS) | Commit on `origin/main` → `bash scripts/manus-auto-deploy.sh` |
| `www.jdstudiohk.com` (Squarespace AEO / homepage blocks) | Push branch/PR → instruct Manus to **merge PR + apply Code Block + Publish Squarespace** (not `website.publish` for jdsys) |

## Do not

- End a Squarespace change by dumping paste instructions as Derek’s job
- Treat “give user the codeblock to copy” as the deploy step when Manus can publish
- Publish `jdsys.biz` for Squarespace-only workstreams
